utation-matrices</span>\n(a)).</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Prove that <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\langle \\chi_\\rho, \\chi_{\\mathrm{triv}} \\rangle\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D712 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D712 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c76\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mi>ρ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">triv</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nequals the average number of fixed points of the permutations <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(g)\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D711 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and also equals <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\dim (\\mathbb{C}^n)^{G}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2102 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>dim</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">C</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>G</mi></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n<li